{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>出道20年的韓國天團BIGBANG日前完成在香港的演唱會，3子將於明日亮相在日本舉行的《2026 MAMA AWARDS》，而組合今日突擊公開新單曲《GiiiRIP》，是繼8月推出的《BiiiG》之後，相隔3個月再發行新歌，粉絲都期待他們明日在《MAMA》上首度演繹新歌。而隊長G-Dragon（GD）有參與《GiiiRIP》的作曲填詞，成員太陽亦有份填詞，與BIGBANG合作多年的製作人TEDDY亦有參與創作。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.960956+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:49:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T03:17:20.908253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:21.841957+00:00","content_hash":"782a3be818edac32761552dcecfbd226adc3b5135743e8781b0bfc1298736be5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}